# Phase 43-03 (PRO-01): Supabase web client configuration.
# Both values are PUBLIC and safe to ship in the client bundle:
#   - VITE_SUPABASE_URL is the project's public REST/Auth endpoint.
#   - VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY is the "anon" public key; it has zero direct
#     table access (RLS revoked for anon on every table — see
#     supabase/migrations/0001_pro_backend.sql) and is protected by Row
#     Level Security + SECURITY DEFINER RPCs, not by secrecy.
# NEVER add a service-role key or any other secret here — this file is
# committed to git and its values ship to every browser (Pitfall 4).
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
